# SkolrMono context

SkolrMono is a modular monorepo for an educational app: multiple services and shared libraries; keep that layout intact unless the user asks to change it.

## Stack

Bun, TypeScript, Fastify, PostgreSQL, Docker, Nuxt.

## Commands

Use Bun (see `bun-package-manager.mdc` — no npm/npx).

- `bun run dev` — development
- `bun run build` — production build
- `bun run start` — production server
